  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASRD Oil Mill Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The group proposes to provide business training for 25 of its members and provide additional economic opportunity for the 37 identified beneficiaries through the purchase of an oil mill and establishment of an edible oil extraction operation. These 37 beneficiaries represent 42 households of between 5 and 8 individuals each. The mill would be housed in building donated by a community member. The business would produce and package cooking oil for human consumption and soya cake by-product extract for livestock feed. The primary target would be the Lusaka markets and area livestock producers.</narrative>
  </description>
